{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":149070,"duration_api_ms":142387,"num_turns":22,"result":"```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Fixed two amendments: (1) In chemistry.rs, changed CO2 K_LA computation from `(k_la_o2 * 0.91).min(1.0)` to `k_la_o2.min(1.0) * 0.91` — cap the O2 K_LA first (matching the O2 reaeration path), then apply the diffusion coefficient ratio. This preserves the physical CO2/O2 = 0.91 ratio even when raw O2 K_LA exceeds the Euler stability cap at high aeration. Extracted the computation into a new `pub fn compute_co2_kla(state)` for testability. (2) Rewrote `test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla` to call the actual `compute_co2_kla()` function instead of manually computing `k_la_o2 * 0.91` (which was a tautology). The new test verifies the ratio holds at both moderate aeration (raw K_LA < 1.0) and full aeration (raw K_LA > 1.0, where the capping bug would have been caught).\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Read chemistry.rs:550-575 and dissolved_oxygen.rs:55-80 to confirm the K_LA capping bug: CO2 used `(k_la_o2 * 0.91).min(1.0)` while O2 used `k_la.min(1.0)`, causing ratio collapse to 1.0 at high aeration\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Extracted `pub fn compute_co2_kla(state: &TankState) -> f64` in chemistry.rs (lines 47-58) with correct cap-then-scale order: `k_la_o2.min(1.0) * KLA_CO2_TO_O2_RATIO`\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated `hourly_chemistry_terms()` in chemistry.rs to call `compute_co2_kla(state)` instead of inline computation\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Rewrote `test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla` in co2_exchange.rs to import and call `compute_co2_kla()`, verifying the 0.91 ratio at moderate aeration (raw K_LA < 1.0) and at full aeration (raw K_LA > 1.0 where capping matters)\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo test --test co2_exchange: 12/12 passed including the rewritten proportionality test\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo test --test chemistry (21/21) and --test dissolved_oxygen (5/5): no regressions\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo fmt --check -p tank_core: clean\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo clippy -p tank_core (lib-only): only pre-existing warnings in unrelated files (shrimp.rs unused imports, biology.rs dead code)\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test co2_exchange: 12 passed, 0 failed — includes rewritten test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla that exercises the actual compute_co2_kla() code path\",\n    \"test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla now asserts: raw O2 K_LA at full aeration > 1.0 (confirming the cap matters), CO2 K_LA < capped O2 K_LA (strictly less due to 0.91 ratio), and ratio = 0.91 within 1e-10 tolerance at both moderate and high aeration\",\n    \"cargo test --test chemistry: 21 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"cargo test --test dissolved_oxygen: 5 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check -p tank_core: clean\",\n    \"cargo clippy -p tank_core (lib): passes with only pre-existing warnings in unrelated files (shrimp.rs, biology.rs)\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"Pre-existing compilation error in shrimp.rs:1105 (wrong argument count to route_consumed_food in test code) blocks `cargo clippy -p tank_core --tests` — unrelated to CO2 changes\",\n    \"Pre-existing unused imports in shrimp.rs and dead code in biology.rs produce warnings under -D warnings — unrelated to CO2 changes\",\n    \"Pre-existing test failure trim_plants_is_closed_sy